      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "# BAGIAN 4 — AlexNet (dari nol)\n",
        "AlexNet **tidak tersedia** di `tf.keras.applications` dan tidak punya bobot ImageNet bawaan, sehingga model dibangun manual dan dilatih **dari nol** (tanpa transfer learning). Dengan hanya 1.470 gambar latih, risiko *overfitting* tinggi, maka ditambahkan:\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Data augmentation** (flip & rotasi) yang hanya aktif saat training,\n",
        "- **BatchNormalization** setelah konvolusi pertama dan kedua,\n",
        "- **Epoch lebih banyak** (`EPOCHS_ALEXNET`) dan learning rate lebih kecil (1e-4).\n",
        "\n",
        "Perbedaan ini membuat perbandingan dengan tiga model lain bukan *apple-to-apple* (transfer learning vs dari nol), dan perlu disebut dalam analisis."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "31379a4c",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "31379a4c"
      },
      "source": [
        "### 4.1 Bangun Model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 27,
      "id": "9f7c20c4",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9f7c20c4"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "EPOCHS_ALEXNET = 40\n",
        "\n",
        "augmentasi = tf.keras.Sequential([\n",
        "    tf.keras.layers.RandomFlip(\"horizontal_and_vertical\"),\n",
        "    tf.keras.layers.RandomRotation(0.1),\n",
        "], name=\"augmentasi\")\n",
        "\n",
        "L = tf.keras.layers\n",
        "\n",
        "inputs = tf.keras.Input(shape=(*IMG_SIZE, 3))\n",
        "x = L.Rescaling(1.0 / 255)(inputs)\n",
        "x = augmentasi(x)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Blok 1\n",
        "x = L.Conv2D(96, 11, strides=4, activation=\"relu\")(x)\n",
        "x = L.BatchNormalization()(x)\n",
        "x = L.MaxPooling2D(pool_size=3, strides=2)(x)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Blok 2\n",
        "x = L.Conv2D(256, 5, padding=\"same\", activation=\"relu\")(x)\n",
        "x = L.BatchNormalization()(x)\n",
        "x = L.MaxPooling2D(pool_size=3, strides=2)(x)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Blok 3-5\n",
        "x = L.Conv2D(384, 3, padding=\"same\", activation=\"relu\")(x)\n",
        "x = L.Conv2D(384, 3, padding=\"same\", activation=\"relu\")(x)\n",
        "x = L.Conv2D(256, 3, padding=\"same\", activation=\"relu\")(x)\n",
        "x = L.MaxPooling2D(pool_size=3, strides=2)(x)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Fully-connected\n",
        "x = L.Flatten()(x)\n",
        "x = L.Dense(4096, activation=\"relu\")(x)\n",
        "x = L.Dropout(0.5)(x)\n",
        "x = L.Dense(4096, activation=\"relu\")(x)\n",
        "x = L.Dropout(0.5)(x)\n",
        "outputs = L.Dense(len(nama_kelas), activation=\"softmax\")(x)"
      ]
    },
